    Libs/AceLocale-3.0: svn://svn.wowace.com/wow/ace3/mainline/trunk/AceLocale-3.0
    Libs/CallbackHandler-1.0: svn://svn.wowace.com/wow/callbackhandler/mainline/trunk/CallbackHandler-1.0
    Libs/LibAboutPanel: git://git.curseforge.net/wow/libaboutpanel/mainline.git
    Libs/LibBabble-Boss-3.0: svn://svn.wowace.com/wow/libbabble-boss-3-0/mainline/trunk
    Libs/LibBabble-SubZone-3.0: svn://svn.wowace.com/wow/libbabble-subzone-3-0/mainline/trunk
    Libs/LibBabble-Faction-3.0: svn://svn.wowace.com/wow/libbabble-faction-3-0/mainline/trunk
